[{:db/id "q-263855/field-1/5d227958e8e2ab9feb7a492bded665cf59dfa9121f7d82334971c99adf799e26" :answer/id #uuid "4ae77203-a0ad-55e8-9054-ac869a2e9a5c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-263855/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "373132ad-b7d9-52b7-aa65-9a416ea1ab51" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-263855/field-1/5d227958e8e2ab9feb7a492bded665cf59dfa9121f7d82334971c99adf799e26" :answer-field/choices ["q-263855/field-1/5d227958e8e2ab9feb7a492bded665cf59dfa9121f7d82334971c99adf799e26"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-263855" :question/id #uuid "4a48f10a-8277-5a69-9c95-d081c4dbbdb9" :question/math-academy-id "q-263855" :question/problem "Given that $P(A)=0.55,$ $P(B)=0.35,$ and $P(A\\cap B)=0.15,$ find $P({A}^{′}\\cap {B}^{′}).$\n\n$P({A}^{′}\\cap {B}^{′})=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, we calculate $P(A\\cup B)$ using the addition law:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(A\\cup B) & =P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cap B) \\\\  & =0.55+0.35-0.15 \\\\  & =0.75\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we construct the corresponding Venn diagram and shade the region ${A}^{′}\\cap {B}^{′}.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14041480/assets/e71239d41a4317c2c7c7015ee2947266075864cec768161fdc4874e8b48f5056.png)\n\nFinally, we have\n\n$$\nP({A}^{′}\\cap {B}^{′})=0.25.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-263855/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5d5731e2-34fa-5e27-84be-324dc958b509"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-263855"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-246758/field-1/2468d3f08d897d95f4d28b48c13e6034ce1716985d166fd89a0b8119476fe5c8" :answer/id #uuid "be1b3223-b448-5c34-9323-bd2b65a5fa39" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-246758/field-1/47e062f84c7679179a100